Description:You control a Swamp and have Unearth and Gitaxian Probe in hand; Embodiment of Agonies is the only card in your graveyard. End the turn at 20 life with Embodiment of Agonies on the battlefield.
Rule:rulesguru-96d878c47e0ae213 | An enters-with-counters replacement is applied while the card is still in its old zone (CR 614.1c, 614.12): Embodiment of Agonies returning from the graveyard counts its own mana cost and enters as a 1/1, so no other card needs to reach the graveyard first
